  "description": "<p>Based on the GET URIs exposed in the REST API, support use of these URIs as resource identifiers in the resource index.  See <a href=\"http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/DEV/Supporting+the+Semantic+Web+and+Linked+Data\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/DEV/Supporting+the+Semantic+Web+and+Linked+Data</a></p>\n\n<p>This could involve</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>rewriting of query output to convert info:fedora/ URIs to HTTP resource URIs</li>\n\t<li>rewriting of query input to convert HTTP URIs to info:fedora URIs</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The info:fedora URI form should be retained for portability etc</p>",
